.SP p2
.L 47.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]Raised on shoujo manga, Fukiko never expected
.L 57.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]her own fantasies to come true — until a strange
.L 67.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]winged cat named Azyrus appeared at her window
.L 77.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]one night and revealed that her late mother had
.L 87.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]secretly been a magical crime fighter. Fukiko's
.L 97.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]locket, a keepsake from her mother, turned out to
.L 107.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]hold that same power, and so the heroine Lovely
.L 117.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]Savior Myu Myu was born.
.L 367.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]Strong-willed and naive, Fukiko expects
.L 377.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]the world to play fair by her own rules.
.L 387.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]That same faith lets her see the good in
.L 397.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]bad situations, though her childish streak
.L 407.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]can also mean a fair amount of whining.
.CP
.SH
\&Fukiko: Ability Notes
.PP
\&Barrier: provides an alternate Defense Roll (the second Defense value in Combat, below)
.SH
\&Fukiko: Attacks
.PP
\&Neko Neko Catnip Cantrip: In her magical girl form, Fukiko can perform a variety of mystical attacks of love.
.PP
\&Neko Neko Heart Burst: Fukiko forms her hands into the shape of a heart over her chest and emits a barrage of magical heart-shaped bursts.
.PP
\&Neko Neko Wave: With a waving motion of her arms, Fukiko pushes away all opponents around her.
.PP
\&Neko Neko Yarn Entangle: A ball of yarn magically appears and wraps around her target.
.SH
\&Fukiko: Lovely Savior Myu Myu
.PP
\&Clutching her locket and shouting her transformation phrase turns Fukiko into her cat-themed magical-girl form, right down to a bell collar and a whole new outfit — villains seem oddly willing to wait out the sequence. She can also use this power just to change her appearance, but not while also using Shape-Shifter.
.SH
\&Fukiko: Azyrus
.PP
\&Beneath his cute exterior, Azyrus is a steady source of advice for Fukiko, even when her naivete exasperates him.
.SH
\&Fukiko: Fluff
.PP
\&\f[NSB]Concept:\f[NSR] Magical Meow Meow Girl, \f[NSB]Birthday:\f[NSR] July 26, \f[NSB]Age:\f[NSR] 12, \f[NSB]Gender:\f[NSR] Female, \f[NSB]Height:\f[NSR] 4'10", \f[NSB]Weight:\f[NSR] 85 lbs., \f[NSB]Hair:\f[NSR] Blonde, \f[NSB]Eyes:\f[NSR] Blue, \f[NSB]Association:\f[NSR] Middle School, \f[NSB]Hobbies:\f[NSR] Shoujo Manga, \f[NSB]Favorite Food:\f[NSR] Chocolate, \f[NSB]Allies:\f[NSR] Azyrus, \f[NSB]Enemies:\f[NSR] Sinister Folk and Their Minions™.
